<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84268" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίκ-ιλμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>broidered stuff, brocade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1013
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφάσμασι καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					375a23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>embroidery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς [πέπλος] κάλλιστος ἔην ποικίλμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.294
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποικίλμασι κεκόσμηται [ἡ
			οἰκία</span>] <i>with various ornaments,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Oec.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πέπλος μεστὸς τῶν . . π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					6c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. καὶ τὰ ζωγραφήματα καὶ τὰ
					πλάσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					298a
				</span></i>
			; of the stars in heaven, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				529c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανοῦ δέμας Χρόνου καλὸν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Critias
					<u>Fr.</u>
					25.34D.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally, <i>variety,
				diversity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				747a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				67a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ῥυθμῶν . . παντοδαπὰ π.
					προσαρμόττοντας τοῖσι φθόγγοις τῆς λύρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					812e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐν διαίτῃ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
					69
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παντοδαπὸν π. τῶν φαινομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
